{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "593b744c14cc095d6b65cc51b60e21b5e50f51a20a653b370df03b9fe499c09f", "ja": "実はさ、お守り買ってきたんだ！\nこの前お参りに行ったから、お土産みたいな。", "zh": "其实啊，我买了护身符来哦！\n前阵子去参拜了，算是当伴手礼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4df333a22b7a4e6d8675e0029f0907779bf59a5f8b443a182b0f211df3accbef", "ja": "アタシの想いもいっぱい込めておいたから、\nご利益バッチリだと思うよ！", "zh": "我还把我的心意满满地寄托在里面了，所以效果肯定特别好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5ed6fdf35e461941ec58a958ff9a8f4d7fb52919f35205342b4351017ca84117", "ja": "ありがとう。大切にさせてもらうよ！\n……あれ？　『縁結び』？", "zh": "谢谢。我会好好珍惜的！\n……咦？“结缘”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b38708f827efb7ff517a6fb0ad94c8041fcf2a7a429e4e4658dc7cda17393281", "ja": "そうそう、{$P$}に絶対必要……\nって、マイガーッ！　それ、友達に渡すやつだ！", "zh": "对对，{$P$}绝对需要……等等，天哪！那是要送给朋友的东西啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "44b7e5209b5e7612e1b2ea3430d42cb2c98a9851144a40d496b5150a0e65ca97", "ja": "{$P$}には『仕事守』を買って……\nあれ、ない！？　間違えて持ってきちゃった～！？", "zh": "要给{$P$}买个『工作守』……\n咦，不见了！？我不小心把它带来了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0582_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0582_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7d1277a1a5f544c3d710d5566ebf3e1c7879529ea1e2fb21c91379382b38c32", "ja": "（その後、改めて『仕事守』をもらった。\n歩の思いに応えるためにも、頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（之后，我重新拿到了『工作御守』。为了回应步的心意，我也得加油才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
